TITLE CO2 Activity Calculation
# Solution at 25°C, pH 7.5, 100 mg/L Ca, 250 mg/L Alkalinity as CaCO3

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.5
    units     mg/L
    Ca        100
    Alkalinity 250 as CaCO3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     co2_activity.out
    -reset    false
    -activities CO2

END
